{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0632_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0632_1000_013hib", "source_sha256": "b49c1b64f01bdb3f1101a37145b0b4c42097bad334ec4b758d0d6b8fe0f595ef", "ja": "ねえ、{$P$}。\nまた動物の役ができるお仕事って、ないかな？", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0632_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0632_1001_013hib", "source_sha256": "6b60b35ac74149744ef1c0056e8d7656ecdc699eaedc16d7547252e1f8e365b5", "ja": "できればシマリスとか、犬とか……\nあ、ヘビでも、オウムでも大丈夫だぞ！", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0632_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0632_1002_p", "source_sha256": "10b5c906cf5e5c3d1f3831433f6a5fc2d8d9e52165b7e92570861b68c4a58c20", "ja": "どうしたんだ、急に？\nシマリスに犬に……全部、響の家族だよな？", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0632_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0632_1003_013hib", "source_sha256": "d705bda21dc7cb04b73443a5490de5f6f36e84224eb401de005153d673802bdb", "ja": "実はみんなが、ブタ太を羨ましがってるんだ。\nほら、この前『三匹の子豚』に出たでしょ？", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0632_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0632_1004_p", "source_sha256": "fa28f2e15dec72ece158eb10bdd7593253dd8f4ec7a24f834ba3fbdfa6b6dcc2", "ja": "響が子豚の長女役をやったんだよな。なるほど。\n次は自分の番だって、みんなが言ってるわけか。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0632_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0632_1005_013hib", "source_sha256": "d9abec1b79b2247564ed28a16da06d76702be9d6a7a045b43f04a8fc75faf5b3", "ja": "うん。でも、しばらく予定はないかもって話したら、\nみんなちょっと落ち込んじゃって……。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0632_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0632_1006_p", "source_sha256": "13f3da5f39eac3fd27c14bf5e622048c74238dee7057164a051c1f8cecbe4dec", "ja": "そうか……。よし、わかった！\n他の動物の役ができる仕事を探してみるよ。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0632_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0632_1007_013hib", "source_sha256": "b48231ffcd8866bc9d1db5515e2351693bcc6064743a8e57f2016e315b3e4f43", "ja": "え、ホント！？　ありがと、{$P$}！\nみんな、すっごく喜ぶぞ～！", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0632_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0632_1008_p", "source_sha256": "61730ffa9d5b75faa1a52d7b51927adabb9e9d07b1ef6f316dec24a10fade09e", "ja": "響と動物の役は、相性もバッチリだしな。\n他の動物も見てみたいって思ってたんだ。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0632_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0632_1009_013hib", "source_sha256": "4691a3912efdc07b5f2d2f500d9bd660f9346c3f633d2b18034ef217ef231f9c", "ja": "えへへ。動物のことなら、自分に任せてよ！\nどんな動物の役も、カンペキに演じてみせるからね！", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
